title: AdviseCare - State Machine - Early-Support Indicator
---

stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> draft : Steward creates the rule
    draft --> active : Steward activates (every enrolled student's latest value is checked)
    active --> archived : Steward archives (no new flags; existing flags are kept)
    draft --> archived : Steward archives an unused draft
    archived --> [*]
